### 1. Add Food Item to Menu (Admin)
### Add Seblak Mi
POST http://localhost:4001/api/canteen/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seblak Mi",
  "price": 4000,
  "category": "Food"
}

### Add Seblak Telor
POST http://localhost:4001/api/canteen/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seblak Telor",
  "price": 4000,
  "category": "Food"
}

